| KPI | Target | Measurement |
|-----|--------|-------------|
| CPU usage | <5% per instance | DAW CPU meter |
| Latency | 0 samples (real-time) | DAW latency compensation |
| Memory | <100MB | Process monitor |
| Load time | <2 seconds | Stopwatch test |
| Crash rate | 0 crashes | DAW stability testing |
| Multi-instance | 16+ instances stable | Stress testing |

## Regulatory/Compliance Requirements

### Code Signing
- **macOS:** Notarization required for distribution outside App Store
- **Windows:** Code signing certificate recommended (not strictly required for small devs)
- **AAX:** Requires Avid developer account and PACE signing

### License Management
- VST3 SDK requires Steinberg license agreement (free)
- AAX SDK requires Avid developer program
- Commercial plugins may require third-party licensing (iLok, custom)

